.claude/

# Python 캐시
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# 판다 펌웨어 빌드 산출물 (소스만 추적 — ADR 2026-07-27-panda-boot-bitrate-and-failsafe)
# 2026-07-28: 경로를 `Tool/`(단수) → `Tools/`(복수) 로 정정. 이전 4줄은 매칭 0건인 죽은 규칙이었다
# (실제 무시는 상류 저장소 자체 파일 Tools/Can_Relay/panda-firmware/.gitignore:4,14 가 수행 중이었음).
Tools/Can_Relay/panda-firmware/board/obj/
Tools/Can_Relay/panda-firmware/board/*.o
Tools/Can_Relay/panda-firmware/board/**/*.o
Tools/Can_Relay/panda-firmware/**/*.elf

# colcon artifacts accidentally created by running the build inside a
# package directory. A nested install/ shadows the workspace one and makes
# ros2 run execute stale code.
src/**/build/
src/**/install/
src/**/log/

# Customer / vendor confidential — meeting material, protocol specs, line topology.
# This repository is PUBLIC (kuks2309/BIG-AMR). CATL protocol tables, Ford system
# diagrams, PLC signal maps and whole-line IP plans must not be published here.
# Store under References/local/ or a private repo. See docs/claude_guideline/
# external_reference/handling.md §5 (licence / external disclosure).
meeting_files/
References/local/

# The same rule, for three files that landed at the repository ROOT rather than
# in either protected directory (found 2026-08-20). They are customer material —
# a CMS development specification, an AGV job description, and a CCS mapping —
# and nothing but their location kept them out of the two paths above.
F Project CMS  개발 사양서.pptx
F_Project_SMALL_AGV_JOB_Description.pptx
Single arm to CCS.xlsx

# The CSM's own records database, written at runtime by `--db`. Generated
# data, not source — and it carries production material identifiers.
csm_records.db
csm_records.db-shm
csm_records.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
